Z||000003||b lo 0||07-26-2000||01:45 PM||||I've been in several bands playing various instruments.  Currently I am playing the bass.  I have also played the drums, trumpet, guitar, synthesizer, turntables, and (yes) the harp.  Music is a great outlet for passion, and I get around to it every day.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Keep in touch, fellow musicians!!<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">  <BR>Go to <A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.i-p.com" TARGET=_blank>www.audioimagery.i-p.com</A>  !!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||tgowens||07-26-2000||01:48 PM||||I played professionally for a number of years -- still play a couple of "oldies" shows a year -- you can see more if you care to look at my web site --  <A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com</A>  -- I was/am/have been a drummer since I was 7 !!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
